て構いません。ご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gCnchOocn_7flgEWVKlyZJFM_dv7A8WV?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@remyaruku65/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3662290, "client_id": 3492967, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d6a273ec/uploads/origins/bd77e2e1-0570-4301-a62b-2efa28712fc8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2fbd8e8bcfcd7a1dc068475a3ac781aa", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d6a273ec/uploads/origins/bd77e2e1-0570-4301-a62b-2efa28712fc8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=897b155ff43c4947c91d329a2af6bc6e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！林という葉っぱの妖精を描いてくれませんか？(Google Driveに参考資料があります。私のSkebページhttps://skeb.jp/@FrostedLeafy）。\n\n村紗南ちゃんと一緒に描いてもらえますか？\n隣に座って何かしているような、仲の良い感じにしてほしいです。\n\n村紗は沈没化石ワールドの衣装で描いてください！(https://en.touhouwiki.net/images/9/9f/Th175Murasa.png)\n\n村紗のコートの一部を林に巻いてもいいです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1Pom4T3wNkOUrg2dkbhWQSBCMkHEdivEK/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 15536, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "朱崎 紫童", "screen_name": "Insanityfactor", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1928340081884139520/wI6g8yfu.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/532141211/1556549831/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 49}, {"id": 827603, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, 